 "text": "Hi, how are you doing right now? Pick them up each time you use the shops, and carry them in basket or bag while you' on the bike. Get a grocery basket if you only use it for shopping. Comes with its own set of challenges. Hold it under the seat tube with the grocery bag tabs sticking out, so you can get one arm each. Then start with the shopping and carry only one arm at a time. Stick one arm in and lift it, turn it on, and off it. It is, and it' worth the investment if you do a lot of shopping.",
